        <div class="eyebrow">STUDIO MOTION STUDY / 01</div><h2>
          Inside the machine.<br /><em>Beyond the black box.</em>
        </h2>
      </div><div class="film-introduction">
        <p>
          A cinematic tour of the system Xynoos hopes to understand. Move
          through the hardware, then follow the idea from observation to a
          bounded response.
